    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome. It\u2019s your first night shift as a staff member at the Napolitan Hotel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tasks at the hotel are very simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main duty is to complete the safety checklist placed on each floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you notice any suspicious objects or items in the hallway, call the front desk to receive appropriate instructions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, there may be situations that the front desk cannot resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elevator you\u2019re in suddenly moves to a floor you didn\u2019t select.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power system unexpectedly shuts down, turning off the hallway lights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange sound gets closer and closer to you...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To prepare for such situations, make sure to familiarize yourself with the <strong>Staff-Only Safety Guidelines</strong> passed down by senior employee Steve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use all your senses to make it through the night shift safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do your job well, you may become the full-time hotel staff member you\u2019ve always wanted to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome. It\u2019s your first night shift as a staff member at the Napolitan Hotel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tasks at the hotel are very simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main duty is to complete the safety checklist placed on each floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you notice any suspicious objects or items in the hallway, call the front desk to receive appropriate instructions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, there may be situations that the front desk cannot resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elevator you\u2019re in suddenly moves to a floor you didn\u2019t select.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power system unexpectedly shuts down, turning off the hallway lights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange sound gets closer and closer to you...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To prepare for such situations, make sure to familiarize yourself with the <strong>Staff-Only Safety Guidelines</strong> passed down by senior employee Steve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use all your senses to make it through the night shift safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do your job well, you may become the full-time hotel staff member you\u2019ve always wanted to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck.</p>",
